	<Wrapper>
		<p class="text-muted font-mono">Projects</p>
		<h3 class="mb-6">Some of my work</h1>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Hello! I'm Zhux, a passionate developer specializing in building web applications. Explore my projects and blog to learn more about my work and interests.
		</p>
	</Wrapper>
	<Wrapper>
		<p class="text-muted font-mono">Blog</p>
		<h3 class="mb-6">Recent Writing</h1>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Hello! I'm Zhux, a passionate developer specializing in building web applications. Explore my projects and blog to learn more about my work and interests.
		</p>
	</Wrapper>
</Layout>
